{"title":"Cowboy Eg","slug":"Cowboy_Eg","pageid":4990,"revid":21353,"timestamp":"2026-04-20T16:40:52Z","lastEditor":"Bartek3796","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Hop 'N' Shop"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v.1.102.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"},{"id":"history","text":"History"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Cowboy Eg</b> is an item that can be obtained after opening the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Western_Eggift/\">Western Eggift</a>. His legs can wobble. this item has the leg wobble physics as the king eg\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li><b>Cowboy Eg</b> is a reference to the game \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://roblox-eg.fandom.com/wiki/Roblox_Eg!_Wiki\"><i>Eg!</i></a>\"</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"history\">History</h2>\n<ul><li>Was added in <span title=\"Version 1.102.0 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVmVyc2lvbl8xLjEwMi4wP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Version 1.102.0</span>, on the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2026_Easter_Event/\">2026 Easter Event</a>.</li></ul>\n\n</div>"}
